0e81a3ea63c10fa63c7b1b52c504","rationale":"[risk_factors] Applied money, user-reach, and change-frequency because the confirmation package name ties the submission to a priced package selection and must stay accurate across content and template changes.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:c0a5f476fc4048fb5f97c1685227229235b4c0b05196b1bf07f904245d2c6a0b","rationale":"[risk_factors] Applied money, user-reach, and change-frequency because the confirmation seat identifies claimed shared capacity and must stay accurate to prevent onboarding disputes.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:fec85b1ea4f2b260ed1da0f109c54ac9b8a4ab9f5b86d6a764870d7205cebf06","rationale":"[risk_factors] Applied money, user-reach, and change-frequency because the `SUB-<n>` reference is the durable submission identifier on a write path tied to package demand.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:50deafced965c83d46325c010f8dc0191324abc979805a47afd5cae5ffafb511","rationale":"[risk_factors] Applied user-reach and change-frequency because the turnaround window is author-facing post-submit guidance likely to regress through copy or template changes.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:4e0e22375a4d66b2d94737583f341e57ec6a594538c9b2cc109ec41bf7a18c7d","rationale":"[risk_factors] Applied money, user-reach, and change-frequency because stale-seat rejection protects shared monthly capacity on a priced package from double-claiming or tampered inputs.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:6436399a0a54cb8411629f8d0865ef017400e1884215c4e0b5094af5032012e0","rationale":"[risk_factors] Applied money, user-reach, and change-frequency because the fully booked message communicates the terminal capacity state for a priced package to all prospective submitters.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:103797658ab209f0252be72d6e92c4aa943defc1a2d2e8b7095c143d05d0a295","rationale":"[risk_factors] Applied money, user-reach, and change-frequency because suppressing the form when capacity is exhausted prevents invalid demand capture against unavailable inventory.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:db566c6120f1e572a4fb431914b8e9765de80e010883ebffb501212b9b696629","rationale":"[applicability] Applicable because the happy path uses the live seat options presented on a package page that accepts submissions.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:db566c6120f1e572a4fb431914b8e9765de80e010883ebffb501212b9b696629","rationale":"[applicability] Applicable because the happy path requires choosing one of the manuscript-status options before submit.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:db566c6120f1e572a4fb431914b8e9765de80e010883ebffb501212b9b696629","rationale":"[applicability] Applicable because the happy path begins from the package form before the default genre prompt is changed.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:db566c6120f1e572a4fb431914b8e9765de80e010883ebffb501212b9b696629","rationale":"[applicability] Applicable because the happy path begins from the package form before the default manuscript-status prompt is changed.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:db566c6120f1e572a4fb431914b8e9765de80e010883ebffb501212b9b696629","rationale":"[applicability] Applicable because the happy path uses the book title input as part of a valid submission.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:db566c6120f1e572a4fb431914b8e9765de80e010883ebffb501212b9b696629","rationale":"[applicability] Applicable because the happy path uses the author name input as part of a valid submission.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:db566c6120f1e572a4fb431914b8e9765de80e010883ebffb501212b9b696629","rationale":"[applicability] Applicable because the happy path uses the email input as part of a valid submission.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:db566c6120f1e572a4fb431914b8e9765de80e010883ebffb501212b9b696629","rationale":"[applicability] Applicable because the happy path uses the onboarding seat select to claim an available seat.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:db566c6120f1e572a4fb431914b8e9765de80e010883ebffb501212b9b696629","rationale":"[applicability] Applicable because the stale-seat rejection path begins from seats originally offered as available before one becomes invalid.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:db566c6120f1e572a4fb431914b8e9765de80e010883ebffb501212b9b696629","rationale":"[applicability] Applicable because the stale-seat rejection path still requires a manuscript-status choice before submit.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:db566c6120f1e572a4fb431914b8e9765de80e010883ebffb501212b9b696629","rationale":"[applicability] Applicable because the stale-seat rejection path begins from the form with the default genre prompt.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:db566c6120f1e572a4fb431914b8e9765de80e010883ebffb501212b9b696629","rationale":"[applicability] Applicable because the stale-seat rejection path begins from the form with the default manuscript-status prompt.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:db566c6120f1e572a4fb431914b8e9765de80e010883ebffb501212b9b696629","rationale":"[applicability] Applicable because the stale-seat rejection path still uses the book title input before submit is rejected.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:db566c6120f1e572a4fb431914b8e9765de80e010883ebffb501212b9b696629","rationale":"[applicability] Applicable because the stale-seat rejection path still uses the author name input before submit is rejected.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:db566c6120f1e572a4fb431914b8e9765de80e010883ebffb501212b9b696629","rationale":"[applicability] Applicable because the stale-seat rejection path still uses the email input before submit is rejected.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:db566c6120f1e572a4fb431914b8e9765de80e010883ebffb501212b9b696629","rationale":"[applicability] Applicable because the stale-seat rejection path still uses the onboarding seat select whose chosen value becomes invalid.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:db566c6120f1e572a4fb431914b8e9765de80e010883ebffb501212b9b696629","rationale":"[applicability] Not applicable because **sc-22** covers a package page with no seats left, where the source says no submission form is offered.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:db566c6120f1e572a4fb431914b8e9765de80e010883ebffb501212b9b696629","rationale":"[applicability] Not applicable because **sc-22** covers a package page with no submission form, so the manuscript-status options are absent by design.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:db566c6120f1e572a4fb431914b8e9765de80e010883ebffb501212b9b696629","rationale":"[applicability] Not applicable because **sc-22** covers a package page with no submission form, so the genre default prompt is absent by design.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:db566c6120f1e572a4fb431914b8e9765de80e010883ebffb501212b9b696629","rationale":"[applicability] Not applicable because **sc-22** covers a package page with no submission form, so the manuscript-status default prompt is absent by design.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:db566c6120f1e572a4fb431914b8e9765de80e010883ebffb501212b9b696629","rationale":"[applicability] Not applicable because **sc-22** covers a package page with no submission form, so no book title input should be present.","by":{"kind":"ai","id":"design-agent"}},{"about":"sha256:db566c6120f1e572a4fb431914b8e9765de80e010883ebffb501212b9b696629","rationale":"[applicability] Not applicable because **sc-22** covers a package page with no submission form, so no author name input should be pres